{"id":"00625b4f58c83284","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-dominating.md","title":"Dominating Number","display":"df-dominating — Dominating Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-dominating","aliases":["58-df-dominating"],"display":"df-dominating — Dominating Number","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-dominating"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-dominating</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dominating — Dominating Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{d}\">\\(\\mathfrak{d}\\)</span> (dominating number)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"{}^\\omega\\omega\">\\({}^\\omega\\omega\\)</span> (Baire space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in{}^\\omega\\omega\">\\(f,g\\in{}^\\omega\\omega\\)</span> (functions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq^*\\subseteq({}^\\omega\\omega)^2\">\\(\\leq^*\\subseteq({}^\\omega\\omega)^2\\)</span> (eventual-domination relation defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DominatingFamily}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{DominatingFamily}_S\\)</span> (dominating-family predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}domination} \\vdash f\\leq^*g\\leftrightarrow f,g\\in{}^\\omega\\omega\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to f(n)\\leq g(n))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}domination} \\vdash f\\leq^*g\\leftrightarrow f,g\\in{}^\\omega\\omega\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to f(n)\\leq g(n))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dominating\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{DominatingFamily}_S(D)\\leftrightarrow D\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\omega\\land\\forall f\\in{}^\\omega\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in D\\;(f\\leq^*g)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dominating\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{DominatingFamily}_S(D)\\leftrightarrow D\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\omega\\land\\forall f\\in{}^\\omega\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in D\\;(f\\leq^*g)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dominating} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak d)\\land\\mathfrak d=\\min\\{|D|:D\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\omega\\land\\operatorname{DominatingFamily}_S(D)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dominating} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak d)\\land\\mathfrak d=\\min\\{|D|:D\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\omega\\land\\operatorname{DominatingFamily}_S(D)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{d}\">\\(\\mathfrak{d}\\)</span> measures the size of the smallest dominating family.</li>\n<li>The cardinal guard distinguishes the cardinal invariant from an arbitrary ordinal representative of the displayed minimum.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1 \\leq \\mathfrak{d} \\leq 2^{\\aleph_0}\">\\(\\omega_1 \\leq \\mathfrak{d} \\leq 2^{\\aleph_0}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak{d}","display":false},{"tex":"{}^\\omega\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f,g\\in{}^\\omega\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq^*\\subseteq({}^\\omega\\omega)^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DominatingFamily}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}domination} \\vdash f\\leq^*g\\leftrightarrow f,g\\in{}^\\omega\\omega\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to f(n)\\leq g(n))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dominating\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{DominatingFamily}_S(D)\\l